From b0d8940b5522caa86ef3039185178d4a56360ad3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diego Amicabile <diego.amicabile@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 23:12:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Borg: look for poison and cut cures in the Alchemy shop

When the Borg is poisoned or bleeding in town, borg_choose_shop() sets
the Temple as its goal and borg_think_shop_buy_useful() only weighs
the wares of that one store.  Both still use store index 3, which was
the Temple in older versions.  In 4.2 index 3 is the Bookseller and the
cure potions are sold in the Alchemy shop, index 4.

So a poisoned or bleeding Borg only looked at books.  A character in
town with gold and Potions of Cure Light Wounds on sale chose no shop
at all, although the same character buys them when healthy.

Use index 4, the Alchemy shop, in both places.

Tracked as diegoami/neo-angband-tracker#23.

(cherry picked from commit 09c28cd59c948fa03fb49349d30e7236b6d067ed)
---
 src/borg/borg-store-buy.c   | 3 ++-
 src/borg/borg-think-store.c | 4 ++--
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/borg/borg-store-buy.c b/src/borg/borg-store-buy.c
index e6841a92f..eb1be2b61 100644
--- a/src/borg/borg-store-buy.c
+++ b/src/borg/borg-store-buy.c
@@ -251,7 +251,8 @@ bool borg_think_shop_buy_useful(void)
         if ((borg.trait[BI_LIGHT] == 0 || borg.trait[BI_FOOD] == 0) && k != 0
             && k != BORG_HOME)
             continue;
-        if ((borg.trait[BI_ISCUT] || borg.trait[BI_ISPOISONED]) && k != 3)
+        /* Cures for poison and cuts are sold in the Alchemy shop */
+        if ((borg.trait[BI_ISCUT] || borg.trait[BI_ISPOISONED]) && k != 4)
             continue;
 
         /* Scan the wares */
diff --git a/src/borg/borg-think-store.c b/src/borg/borg-think-store.c
index 08f4c48db..f6796e14d 100644
--- a/src/borg/borg-think-store.c
+++ b/src/borg/borg-think-store.c
@@ -102,9 +102,9 @@ bool borg_choose_shop(void)
     if (borg.goal.shop != -1 && borg.goal.ware != -1)
         return true;
 
-    /* If poisoned or bleeding -- flow to temple */
+    /* If poisoned or bleeding -- flow to the Alchemy shop */
     if (borg.trait[BI_ISCUT] || borg.trait[BI_ISPOISONED])
-        borg.goal.shop = 3;
+        borg.goal.shop = 4;
 
     /* If Starving  -- flow to general store */
     if (borg.trait[BI_FOOD] == 0
-- 
2.53.0

